<section id="navigation">
  <h2>Finding your way</h2>

  <p>
    Opening the app takes you to today's entries of the project you used last. With
    several projects and none remembered yet, you pick one first.
  </p>

  <dl>
    <dt>The org | project button</dt>
    <dd>
      Shows the org and project you are working in. It lists every org you are a member of
      and, below each org, the projects you take part in. Pick a project to open it: it opens
      again the next time you sign in. Pick an org to see all its projects.
    </dd>

    <dt>yesterday · today · tomorrow</dt>
    <dd>Once a project is selected: jump to that day of the current project.</dd>

    <dt>👤 Account</dt>
    <dd>Your name, email, password and sessions, and the display mode (dark, light or as your system).</dd>

    <dt>⚙ Settings</dt>
    <dd>
      The selected org, its projects and your other orgs, and Logout. Owners of the org also
      find the link to manage its members here.
    </dd>

    <dt>?</dt>
    <dd>This page.</dd>
  </dl>

  <h3>On a day</h3>

  <dl>
    <dt>add or edit · view all</dt>
    <dd>Switch between your own editable entries and everyone's entries of the day.</dd>

    <dt>⬅️ ➡️</dt>
    <dd>The previous and the next day.</dd>

    <dt>todo · doing · done</dt>
    <dd>The status of an entry. Changes to an entry save when you leave the field; Esc undoes them.</dd>

    <dt>validate</dt>
    <dd>Checks your time markup of the day; when it adds up, shows your working time.</dd>

    <dt>🔒 unlock to edit</dt>
    <dd>Past days are read-only. Unlocking covers the whole day until you leave the page.</dd>
  </dl>

  <h3>On a project</h3>

  <dl>
    <dt>days · weeks · months</dt>
    <dd>All entries day by day, or each member's time and tags per week or month.</dd>

    <dt>validate times</dt>
    <dd>Lists every day whose times do not add up.</dd>

    <dt>Export Month · Export days</dt>
    <dd>A CSV of the month, or of one member's days, for owners of the org or the project.</dd>

    <dt>manage</dt>
    <dd>For owners of the org or the project: rename or archive it, add and remove participants, change their role.</dd>
  </dl>
</section>
